  "label": "Stereotype: Indigenous women are violent or dangerous",
  "description": "This stereotype falsely claims that Indigenous women are inherently violent or prone to aggression, often used to justify their marginalization or to portray them as threats to society. It is a racist trope that ignores the reality of Indigenous women’s experiences and contributes to the erasure of their humanity.",
